            <div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Instant Search</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Filter through active students in milliseconds using optimized queries.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
            <div class="bg-white rounded shadow-sm me-3 border d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 60px; height: 60px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                <i class="fas fa-edit fs-4 text-warning"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Data Validation</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Built-in annotations ensure all student records are highly accurate.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
            <div class="bg-white rounded shadow-sm me-3 border d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 60px; height: 60px; flex-shrink: 0;">
